cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "bengali-postocr-sllm: zero-shot small-language-model post-correction of historical Bengali OCR"
type: software
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Rahman
    given-names: Arifur
    affiliation: "Department of Computer Science and Engineering, Bangladesh University of Business and Technology"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ariffurrhmn/bengali-postocr-sllm"
abstract: >-
  Code, frozen page lists, prompts, analysis scripts and numeric summaries for a
  study of zero-shot post-correction of historical Bengali OCR (40 pages of the
  REID2019 British Library ground truth, Tesseract and EasyOCR) with small open
  language models, a dictionary baseline, a fine-tuning pilot and a large model.
keywords:
  - Bengali OCR
  - post-OCR correction
  - small language models
  - historical documents
  - negative results
references:
  - type: data
    title: "Ground Truth transcriptions for training OCR of historical Bengali printed texts (REID2019), version 2"
    authors:
      - name: "Tom Derrick"
      - name: "British Library"
    doi: "10.23636/1168"
